# No em dash / en dash

Never use the Unicode characters `-` (em dash, U+2014) or `-` (en dash, U+2013) in Sociva code, comments, UI copy, docs, SQL, or Codemagic YAML.

Always use a plain ASCII hyphen-minus: `-`

Examples:
- Bad: `Home-cooked dum biryani - layered the slow way`
- Good: `Home-cooked dum biryani - layered the slow way`

This avoids an "AI-generated" look in the product.
